# Build-time only. Used by src/lib/youtube.ts during `astro build` to bake the
# Work page's playlists into the HTML. Never referenced by anything that ships
# to a browser — the live top-up goes through the Apps Script proxy instead, so
# no key ever lands in dist/.
#
# Get one at console.cloud.google.com: create a project, enable "YouTube Data
# API v3", then Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key. Restrict it to
# that one API. It reads public playlists only.
#
# Absent is a valid state: the build succeeds without it, the grids are filled
# in the browser instead, and only search-engine indexing of the video titles
# is lost.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
